('spec-bible-01', 'Human', 'Earth', '60-100 years', 'Standard mammalian humanoid biology.', 'Intelligence, adaptability, endurance, tool use, problem-solving.', 'Disease, injury, aging, and extreme environments.', 'Family, community, survival, ambition, religion, science, wealth, freedom, and identity.', 'Thousands of regional and national languages', 'Billions', 'CANON', 'Biological / Sentient', 'Common / Active', 'Nation-states, territories, and organizations', 'Industrial to advanced', 'The dominant natural species of Earth. Humanity compensates for limited individual biology through intelligence, adaptability, technology, cooperation, and determination.', 'Evolved naturally on Earth.'),
