('spec-bible-06', 'Cyborg', 'Usually Earth', 'Variable', 'Organic and artificial components coexist.', 'Weapons, sensors, artificial limbs, armor, neural interfaces, and augmentation.', 'Mechanical failure, hacking, energy dependency, and biological rejection.', 'Identity and the boundary between humanity and machinery are central themes.', 'Human / digital', 'Rare', 'CANON', 'Cybernetic Organism', 'Active', 'None unified', 'Advanced', 'Cyborgs are biological organisms integrated with significant mechanical or technological systems.', 'Biological beings modified with technology.'),
